  "body": "Heart of Takapuna|Bespoke Design|Coastal Living\r\n\r\nNamed after the Irish word Cill Airne - meaning \"the church by the sloe trees\" - Killarney carries a sense of warmth, character and timeless charm.\r\n\r\nAt 65 Killarney Street, that same spirit is reimagined through a boutique collection of beautifully crafted brand-new homes, thoughtfully designed for contemporary living in one of Takapuna's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods. Each residence has been carefully crafted to bring together comfort, quality and enduring appeal.\r\n\r\n*Property Docs (copy & paste the link below into your browser & scroll down): https://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35737\r\n**Photos are indicative and may showcase various homes within the development.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern living, these contemporary residences balance elegant open-plan entertaining, flexible family living and private retreat. With a choice of three or four bedrooms, generous bathroom configurations and double internal-access garaging, each home has been designed to complement different lifestyles and stages of life.\r\n\r\nDevelopment Highlights:\r\n- Choice of 3 or 4 bedrooms\r\n- 2.5 or 3.5 bathrooms\r\n- 65A stands apart with a private internal LIFT - a rare luxury offering effortless access, everyday convenience and future-proofed living\r\n- 65B & 65C offer generous 4-bedroom layouts with thoughtfully separated spaces, ideal for families and multi-generational living\r\n- 65D showcases premium Italian porcelain surfaces by Florim, bringing refined European style and durability to the kitchen\r\n- Double internal-access garaging\r\n- Floor areas ranging from approximately 159m2; to 203m2; (+/-)\r\n- Flexible ground-floor accommodation ideal for guests, extended family or working from home\r\n- Selected homes feature two master ensuites\r\n- Sleek, contemporary kitchens flowing seamlessly into open-plan living, dining and balcony spaces\r\n- Premium finishes and carefully considered materials throughout\r\n- Backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned to embrace the very best of Takapuna living, these homes place you moments from Takapuna Beach, Lake Pupuke, vibrant cafes, acclaimed restaurants and boutique shopping, with convenient access to major transport connections.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate zoning for Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls' High School and Takapuna Grammar School.\r\n\r\nRefined design, thoughtful functionality and an exceptional coastal lifestyle - your opportunity to own brand-new in the heart of Takapuna starts here.",
